{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then","id":816825,"title":"The Pack and what else then?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-26T06:24:10-08:00","id":816825,"title":"The Pack and what else then?","content":"The Pack is almost with us! The book is in Art Direction (and editing, I guess), and I'm looking forward to this book as seems it will function somewhat like a player's guide.<br /> <br /> In fact, I'm not sure I know exactly what really IS in the book. Anyone can clear that?<br /> <br /> And what about after that? What kind of books can we expect for the line, or what books do you want to see?<br /> <br /> For me, three books I would like to see:<br /> <br /> - Something like &quot;The Prey&quot;. An Antagonists 2.0, with more on hosts and the pure. Perhaps divided among the Siskur-dah for each pack.<br /> - Another book would be something delving a lot more on the Shadow. Like book of spirits, but more focused on Werewolves, and the stranger things we can find in the Shadow.<br /> - And finally, something on &quot;higher level&quot; games of Werewolf. What happens when they reach greater Primal Urge? What about those uratha that survived centuries? Like Lycaon-Ur, can an uratha become a totem, and how would he interact with the higher strata of the spirit world?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T07:48:18-08:00","id":816873,"title":"","content":"I was just getting on these forums to ask if there had been any spoilers from The Pack. It moved along pretty quickly, while we were distracted by the core still and <b>Beast</b>.<br /> <br /> Aren't we getting a Secrets of the Tribes afterwards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T08:29:59-08:00","id":816904,"title":"","content":"Nothing spoiled or disclosed, from <b>The Pack</b> or future supplements afaik. The hype is over <b>Dark Ages</b>, otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T08:55:22-08:00","id":816916,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Dark Eras will have these great scenarios for Werewolf, and I can't wait as well. I've been wanting to run a Viking game for years now, and this will scratch the itch and maybe even tear the flesh. I'm planning a game set in my regular WtF scenario set in the 70s, showing how and why some things are the way they are now. Neolithic will be epic, specially running a crossover game with Mage. And Forsaken by Rome will be fun as it seems it's possible a forsaken-pure mixed pack? We will see. Also, I might get to show the origin of one of the main antagonists of my regular game.<br /> <br /> Didn't heard of a Secrets of the Tribes, but that would be really cool if so. Perhaps the 2.0 Pure might show here, then!<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T08:57:51-08:00","id":816918,"title":"","content":"I'm currently working on a couple of artworks for The Pack, you will find more than you think.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T11:00:12-08:00","id":816994,"title":"","content":"Secrets of the Tribes was announced at GenCon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T11:05:29-08:00","id":816998,"title":"","content":"Once the text is back from editing, there's a greater chance of getting some info on what's in The Pack. I think it'll please people!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=816918#post816918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm currently working on a couple of artworks for The Pack, you will find more than you think.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div> Great, I like your artwork so hopefully it's for my sections <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T12:05:28-08:00","id":817045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=816994#post816994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Secrets of the Tribes was announced at GenCon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are <b>Secrets of the Tribes</b> the proposed by fans before <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/425614-petition-for-tribes-of-the-moon-2e-working-title\"><b>Tribes of Moon</b> supplements</a> series?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T12:11:38-08:00","id":817051,"title":"","content":"It says, 'This supplement is in-depth look at the tribes of the Uratha, their customs, traditions, and their sacred prey.' So, somewhat like an annotated version, I suppose. If it's anything like Secrets of the Covenants, it will be in-character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T12:45:01-08:00","id":817065,"title":"","content":"I was just about to ask the same thing too. I see The Pack is finishing but what exactly is in it? I always assumed that it has pack dynamics and structures for players to work with. But that was pretty much all I can think of with this supplement. As for other future supplements I'm hoping the Pure is in secrets of the tribes. At this point I really want a supplement that deals with high PU werewolves; just like vampire is getting A Thousand Years of Night. With that and Dark Eras my friends and I will be crying tears of joy. <br /> <br /> Oh I forgot to mention. What about the bale hounds? Will they be somewhat the same like in 1E or will they be a tribe or what? That's another supplement I would like to see in the future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2360,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","user":"Cecoyotl","date":". 01-26-2016, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T13:05:29-08:00","id":817086,"title":"","content":"From what we've been told, Stew Wilson wants to give the Bale Hounds proper treatment, which implies not a chapter in the end of another book.<br /> <br /> As for the Pack, it seems to be about the pack structure and members who aren't werewolves and what they do in the pack. It looks like it may have more information about the Pure, and I believe there's been mention of a pack that contains both Forsaken and Pure members, as well as possible animal members, like wolves.<br /> <br /> ''One part family, one part gang, and one part military unit, a werewolf\u2019s pack ties her to other werewolves, Wolf-Blooded, and a wide network of humans that ground her in the mundane world. This book is a thorough look at the pack from within and without.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T14:01:50-08:00","id":817147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cecoyotl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=817065#post817065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh I forgot to mention. What about the bale hounds? Will they be somewhat the same like in 1E or will they be a tribe or what? That's another supplement I would like to see in the future.</div> </div> </div> </div>You should check out/contribute to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/815913-sell-me-on-the-bale-hounds\">this thread</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T14:03:23-08:00","id":817148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cecoyotl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=817065#post817065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was just about to ask the same thing too. I see The Pack is finishing but what exactly is in it? I always assumed that it has pack dynamics and structures for players to work with. But that was pretty much all I can think of with this supplement.</div> </div> </div> </div>then you will be satisfied believe me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> A pack have not only internal dynamics<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T14:05:00-08:00","id":817150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=816998#post816998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once the text is back from editing, there's a greater chance of getting some info on what's in The Pack. I think it'll please people!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Great, I like your artwork so hopefully it's for my sections <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>oh thank you so much <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> I'm so glad to see my pieces near your work <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T15:02:52-08:00","id":817193,"title":"","content":"I hope that <b>Pack</b> is place where we will see 2ED Lodges mechanics. They were very missed in corebook, but there are rumors the Lodges could not be condensed to less than 14 pages and simply did not have place in new <b>Forsaken</b> core.<br /> <br /> Seeing how Lodges are, in reality, &quot;superpacks with another Totem&quot;, it would be fitting to see them finally in <b>Pack</b> book, in whole their glory. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T23:59:47-08:00","id":817439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=817147#post817147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You should check out/contribute to <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/815913-sell-me-on-the-bale-hounds&amp;quot;]this</a> thread[/url]</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh I've been meaning to comment. Somehow it keeps slipping out of my mind, my bad. He he he... <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope that Pack is place where we will see 2ED Lodges mechanics. They were very missed in corebook, but there are rumors the Lodges could not be condensed to less than 14 pages and simply did not have place in new Forsaken core.<br /> <br /> Seeing how Lodges are, in reality, &quot;superpacks with another Totem&quot;, it would be fitting to see them finally in Pack book, in whole their glory.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would love to see lodge mechanics in The Pack. I have a few great ideas for lodges that I would like to make and use for my games. But for some reason I keep having this pessimistic thought that its not going to happen in this book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> maybe Stew might do a post on lodge mechanics (I hope).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T17:01:47-08:00","id":822888,"title":"","content":"I hope that the Pack includes some information about Kuruth. Between the regenerative powers of the Crinos Form and the time spent in Kuruth, it is a very powerful, and very terrifying aspect of the game. I think a narrative on attitudes towards death rage, as well as tweaked mechanics could really expand on this.<br /> <br /> There was a supplement for Requiem for SAS which was called Scenes of a frenzy, I think a scenes of A Death Rage would be a cool idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly","name":"maryshelly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T14:07:29-08:00","id":823702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maryshelly</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/816825-the-pack-and-what-else-then?p=822888#post822888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope that the Pack includes some information about Kuruth. Between the regenerative powers of the <b>Gauru</b> Form and the time spent in Kuruth, it is a very powerful, and very terrifying aspect of the game. I think a narrative on attitudes towards death rage, as well as tweaked mechanics could really expand on this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Emphasis mine.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-07T21:51:14-08:00","id":825764,"title":"","content":"Interestingt information, I'll be sure to keep a eye out for The Pack when it comes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T07:15:12-07:00","id":847055,"title":"","content":"Just noticed this sucker was in Layout back on the 7th. Think we might get it by next month at the latest. Any new teases the Dev or writers feel up for dropping our way?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T07:36:16-07:00","id":847057,"title":"","content":"We can hope. We've gotten a few clues scattered around, some were hints in First Tongue.<br /> <br /> I certainly hope it comes before next month but I've got no idea how long the different sections take, it seems like everyone has a different views on how long they last but in reality seems to be wildly different book by book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T07:42:25-07:00","id":847058,"title":"","content":"Whoa, got a shortcut for me to where these clues are? Did anyone translate the First Tongue one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":